========================================================================================
TAKEAWAY
========================================================================================
  1. The colored reservoir is the exact finite CRT object: actual
     witnesses at q=14V equal colored grid hits in G_P cap C_b(E).
  2. Sigma(P,E)=sum_b meas(G_P cap C_b(E)) is large in the structured
     bank; the minimum found is printed above and is far from zero.
  3. This suggests replacing the last placement problem by an
     Erdos-Turan/Koksma bound for 14 colored arithmetic progressions.
     The denominator D=14q-r route becomes: conditional blockers cannot
     cover all colored grid hits when V*Sigma is large.
  4. LRC(14) is not proved here: the missing theorem is a uniform
     discrepancy bound plus a finite small-V check, not just this census.
